WEBVTT

00:00:19.861 --> 00:00:21.655
[VOLDEMORT CHUCKLES]

00:00:21.696 --> 00:00:24.199
VOLDEMORT:
They never learn.

00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:27.369
Such a pity.

00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:31.081
But, my Lord...

00:00:31.122 --> 00:00:33.541
...shouldn't we wait for...?

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.293
My Lord.

00:00:40.465 --> 00:00:41.967
Begin.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:02.529
[RUMBLING]

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:04.906
That's what you want too,
isn't it, Helena?

00:01:10.495 --> 00:01:11.871
You want it destroyed.

00:01:11.913 --> 00:01:15.083
Another swore to destroy it
many years ago...

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:18.128
...a strange boy with a strange name.

00:01:18.169 --> 00:01:21.131
-Tom Riddle.
-But he lied.

00:01:21.172 --> 00:01:22.465
He's lied to many people.

00:01:22.507 --> 00:01:25.760
I know what he's done! I know who he is!

00:01:25.802 --> 00:01:28.680
He defiled it with dark magic!

00:01:43.695 --> 00:01:47.365
HARRY:
I can destroy it once and for all.

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:52.329
But only if you tell me where he hid it.

00:01:54.289 --> 00:02:00.045
You do know where he hid it,
don't you, Helena?

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:04.049
You just have to tell me.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.344
Please.

00:02:19.064 --> 00:02:21.399
Strange.

00:02:24.235 --> 00:02:27.364
You remind me of him a bit.

00:02:28.531 --> 00:02:29.824
It's here...

00:02:30.492 --> 00:02:33.745
...in the castle, in the place where
everything is hidden.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:38.458
If you have to ask...

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.794
...you will never know.

00:02:41.795 --> 00:02:44.756
If you know, you need only ask.

00:02:46.925 --> 00:02:48.635
Thank you.

00:02:53.515 --> 00:02:55.058
[STUDENTS CLAMORING]

00:03:01.398 --> 00:03:05.652
Tell Professor McGonagall Remus and I
will handle this side of the castle.

00:03:06.528 --> 00:03:08.238
Yes, sir.

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:14.911
SHACKLEBOLT: Hey, Dean, on second
thoughts, tell Professor McGonagall...

00:03:14.953 --> 00:03:17.789
...we might need one or two more wands
this side.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:23.378
REMUS: It is the quality of one's
convictions that determines success...

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.338
...not the number of followers.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.382
Who said that?

00:03:27.799 --> 00:03:29.384
Me.

00:03:34.097 --> 00:03:36.015
You okay, Freddie?

00:03:36.391 --> 00:03:37.809
Yeah.

00:03:39.269 --> 00:03:40.979
Me too.

00:03:49.404 --> 00:03:51.614
[SPEAKING IN PARSELTONGUE]

00:03:58.079 --> 00:04:01.708
Harry talks in his sleep.
Have you noticed?

00:04:02.584 --> 00:04:04.627
No, of course not.

00:04:30.778 --> 00:04:32.989
[YELLING AND SCREAMING
IN DISTANCE]

00:04:52.175 --> 00:04:53.968
Yeah?

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.512
You and whose army?

00:05:15.698 --> 00:05:17.492
-You do it.
-I can't.

00:05:17.534 --> 00:05:19.619
Yes, you can.

00:05:47.188 --> 00:05:48.898
[YELLS]

00:05:50.066 --> 00:05:51.693
[GASPS]

